uture don't forget that  much of the world views LD ins as the  spawn of the devil and this type of vile  propaganda is deeply ingrained into the  psyche of the marlins  and other nations even though this  propaganda is indeed false there is no  devil to speak of it would be naive for  Aaron to assume that sacrificing himself  to get the LD ins and other nations to  work together would automatically lead  to world peace I mean if we just look at  our own world even though most of the  world had a common enemy in the Axis  powers during World War two as soon as  World War two ended the Allies turned on  each other and the Cold War began  another scenario is that Aaron will just  go full villain although this one is  highly unlikely  in this scenario Aaron develops a god  complex like Light Yagami from Death  Note and Aaron uses Amir's powers and  the rumbling to rule the world with an  iron fist he may even decide to consume  all nine Titan powers to make himself as  powerful as possible and maybe even  defeat the curse since we now know that  a mere fritz did not die because of an  illness or curse it is possible that  someone who possesses all nine Titan  powers at once is immune from the  dreaded curse of aamir but this would  require Aaron to change completely as a  character instead of freedom he would be  embracing tyranny and he would  potentially be required to kill his own  friends like Armin in order to consume  all nine Titan powers this scenario is  fun to think about in terms of seeing a  protagonist turning into a complete  deranged villain but I personally don't  buy it at all although after that game  of Thrones final season nothing would  shock me at this point probably the most  realistic scenario for what Aaron will  do next and how the attack on Titan  story will end is that the world of  attack on Titan will end up looking a  lot like our own world in this scenario  Aaron uses the rumbling to destroy all  the armies who are trying to threaten  parodies but then instead of  using fear and the threat of further  destruction to keep the other nations in  line he actually decides to embrace  technological progress a process that  has already started on the island of  parodies Aaron uses the threat of the  Titans as a way to keep the other  nations at bay while the people in  parodies catch up to everyone else in  terms of modern technology and weaponry  that way even though modern technology  will one day completely surpassed the  power of the Titans the LD ins will  still be able to defend themselves  because they will also possess the most  advanced weapons eventually Aaron could  even use Amir's power to take away the  ability of aliens to transform into  Titans in the first place and then the  LD ins would be just like every other  nation in the world  no Titan curse no children of the devil  just good old-fashioned firepower this  scenario requires Aaron to engage not  only in destruction but also in  statecraft Aaron would have to become  more than just a soldier he would have  to become a statesman a ruler who is  working to build a modern and prosperous  nation he would have to build  partnerships and alliances with other  nations like his uru he would have to  grow the economy promote trade and so on  eventually once the attack on Titan  world develops the equivalent of nuclear  weapons the audience could protect  themselves through the principle of  mutually assured destruction this is the  concept that if two countries both  possess incredible weapons of mass  destruction like nuclear weapons going  to war with each other would lead to the  destruction of both countries  if either country attacks the other both  will be destroyed because both have  enough weapons to destroy the other in  such a war there would be no winner and  for this reason there is no incentive to  ever go to war in the first place  if the story of attack on titan decides  to go in a practical real politic  direction then this would be the most  likely scenario for the ending this type  of ending isn't the most dramatic or  explosive and being dramatic and  explosive is definitely what attack on  titan does best but if he decides to  make the ending one in which not  everyone has to die and one in which the  audience have a future Hajime isayama  may opt for this realpolitik ending that  focuses on statesmanship and realist  international relations personally I am  undecided on which type of ending  isayama will ultimately  shoes my personal opinion is that he  will probably go either with the  Ragnarok ending or with the  statesmanship ending but I would be a  fool if I said that I can predict what a  syama will do  he has surprised all of us so many times  in the past so at the end of the day we  just have to sit back and enjoy the ride  let me know what you guys think do you  like any of the scenarios that I  discussed or do you have a totally  different idea  hit me up down in the comments if you  enjoyed this video and you want to see  more attack on titan content here on the  channel please leave a like to let me  know and if you happen to be new to  anime uproar don't forget to subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all notifications you could also  follow me on twitter and instagram at  anime uproar for all the latest attack  on titan news and updates i want to give  a big thank you to all of our anime out  pro patrons who make videos like this  one possible special thank you to all of  our pro hero to your patrons including  the one and only Gilgamesh nothing but a  fan Jason Wilson King's eldest son he'll  cruise stealers poet Pablo  atropos Wraith very dolla beat karate  GaN Anatoly Cassatt's ki  TJ Nathaniel and alpha do and I can't  forget the ones that rise above all  other clans a massive thank you to all  of our the one tier patrons including in  grata alone Adam Maddie Mac makoto-kun  and yuh boys Seth if you enjoy our  videos and you think that they add some